<title>USA: U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Sept 12.</title>
<headline>U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Sept 12.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury said it will auction $19.25 billion of 52-week bills on Sept 12 to pay down $25 million as $19.275 billion of 52-week bills are maturing.</p>
<p>The bills will be issued Sept 19 and mature Sept 18, 1997.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the bills will be 9127942U7.</p>
</text>
